Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Export/Import Framework|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Edit Export Template
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Export|
	And LAR add Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
	And LAR configure Export Options
		|checkContentNameList|Web Content|
		|uncheckContentNameList|Blogs|
	And LAR save Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
	And LAR export Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
		|larFileName|Export.Template|
	And Pause at locator '3000'
	And LAR download Lar
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And LAR import Site CP
		|larFileName|Export.Template|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit CP
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And WebContent view CP
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Export|
	And LAR goto Export Template CP
	And LAR edit Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescriptionEdit|Export Template Description Edit|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
		|exportTemplateNameEdit|Export Template Name Edit|
	And LAR configure Export Options
		|checkContentNameList|Blogs|
	And LAR save Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description Edit|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name Edit|
	And LAR export Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description Edit|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name Edit|
		|larFileName|Edited Export Template Name|
	And these variables
		|larFile||
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Successful' at locator 'SitePagesExport#CURRENT_AND_PREVIOUS_STATUS'
	And LAR download Lar
	And Pause at locator '5000'
	And LAR import Site CP
		|larFileName|${larFile}|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry CP
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	Then BlogsEntry view Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
