Scenario: Export Import Portlet With ADT
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Application Display Templates|
	And ApplicationDisplayTemplates add CP
		|adtFile|adt_blogs_basic.ftl|
		|adtType|Blogs|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
	And ApplicationDisplayTemplates select Portlet ADT
		|adtType|Blogs|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
	And these variables
		|key_entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And AssertElementNotPresent the value 'Edit' at locator 'Link#EDIT'
	And AssertElementNotPresent the value 'Move to the Recycle Bin' at locator 'Link#MOVE_TO_THE_RECYCLING_BIN'
	And LAR configure Export Site CP
	And AssertClick the value 'Export' at locator 'SitePagesExport#EXPORT_BUTTON'
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Successful' at locator 'SitePagesExport#CURRENT_AND_PREVIOUS_STATUS'
	And these variables
		|valueName|selenium#getText('//ul/li/div/h5')|
