Scenario: Import Corrupted File
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Bookmarks|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Bookmarks' at locator 'Portlet#HEADER'
	Then LAR import Portlet
		|cannotImport|true|
		|larFileName|bookmarks-corrupted.portlet.lar|
		|uploadFrom|dependencies|